{"id":"planning-administrative-duration","title":"How long did Planning records remain open?","question":"How do completed administrative record intervals compare with the age of unclosed Planning records?","finding":"Project records and related Planning records have separate identifiers and workflows. The table counts observed closures, selected active statuses and records with a final-looking status but no closure date.","how":"Count each record within its own source. Subtract opening from the recorded closure date. For explicitly active records with no close date, age runs to November 12, 2026. Other statuses are retained separately. Cohorts by opening year reflect different lengths of follow-up.","limits":"A closure can follow withdrawal, approval or another outcome. Multiple related records can belong to a project. Neither administrative closure nor project opening supplies all triggers for statutory review deadlines.","tier":"OFFICIAL","columns":[{"k":"stream","t":"Register","type":"text"},{"k":"year","t":"Opening year","type":"text"},{"k":"n","t":"Opened","type":"int"},{"k":"closed","t":"Dated closures","type":"int"},{"k":"missing","t":"Final-looking status, no close date","type":"int"},{"k":"active","t":"Selected active statuses","type":"int"},{"k":"other","t":"Other/unusable","type":"int"},{"k":"median","t":"Median closed duration","type":"days"},{"k":"p90","t":"90th percentile closed duration","type":"days"},{"k":"age","t":"Median age of active","type":"days"}],"rows":[{"stream":"Project record","year":2012,"n":1432,"closed":176,"missing":1251,"active":2,"other":3,"median":1392,"p90":1820,"age":5232},{"stream":"Project record","year":2013,"n":1773,"closed":402,"missing":1365,"active":2,"other":4,"median":994,"p90":1856,"age":4948},{"stream":"Project record","year":2014,"n":2322,"closed":1330,"missing":708,"active":264,"other":20,"median":300,"p90":1438,"age":4508},{"stream":"Project record","year":2015,"n":2214,"closed":2145,"missing":7,"active":37,"other"